data.title:
Run cat > /tmp/pr-714-review.json <<'EOF'
{
  "event": "COMMENT",
  "body": "## Review Summary\n\n**Task:** @01KK77F3PEZH292XN0MAPQAH66\n**Spec:** @session-events\n\n### AC Coverage\n- [ ] `@session-events ac-7`: the PR changes the session-end commit path, but it adds no regression test that proves terminal invocation outcomes actually create a shadow-branch commit. Existing coverage in `tests/sessions.test.ts` only verifies generic commit-boundary behavior.\n\n### Code Quality\n- [ ] `shadowPull()` now changes behavior for dirty worktrees, but the PR adds no test covering the stash/pull/pop path that is supposed to eliminate false conflict warnings.\n\n### Regression Check\n- [x] Targeted suites pass on PR head via `npx vitest run tests/agent-invocation-lifecycle.test.ts tests/shadow.test.ts tests/shadow-sync-scheduler.test.ts`\n- [ ] Local `npm test` could not be confirmed because the repo's pretest build failed in `packages/web-ui` with `ENOENT ... .svelte-kit/output/server/manifest-full.js`; CI was still running when reviewed\n\nThis PR is not ready to merge because the two new regression paths are untested.",
  "comments": [
    {
      "path": "src/agent-runtime/invocation.ts",
      "line": 428,
      "side": "RIGHT",
      "body": "**MUST-FIX**: This is the bug fix for `@session-events ac-7`, but the PR adds no regression test proving a real shadow worktree gets a commit when an invocation ends. Please add coverage around `runInvocation()` that exercises at least one terminal path against an initialized shadow repo and asserts the resulting shadow commit/files."
    },
    {
      "path": "src/parser/shadow.ts",
      "line": 1609,
      "side": "RIGHT",
      "body": "**MUST-FIX**: The stash/pull/pop path is the second behavior change in this PR, and there is no test for the dirty-worktree case that was causing false `conflict detected` warnings. Add a regression test around `shadowPull()` that starts with local uncommitted shadow changes plus a remote update, then verifies the pull succeeds without `hadConflict` and preserves the local edits."
    }
  ]
}
EOF

gh api repos/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pulls/714/reviews --method POST --input /tmp/pr-714-review.json

